# Diagnosis ladder 3/3 (2026-10-25): lab_e_exp_pid_u0.fly with the figure-8 at HALF speed (f8_laps=1, firmware default 2; move_s stays 18: firmware caps move+ret+hold at 25 s).
# Question: is the figure-8 failure the path or the loop? 10-24 lqr-alone: path x ~0.36 Hz, y ~0.18 Hz (zero
# crossings), but the response swung at its own ~0.45-0.50 Hz in both axes (same as the hold wobble), 1.7x the path.
# At half speed: wobble still ~0.5 Hz and about as big = the xy loop itself (lightly damped / limit cycle);
# swing falls toward 1x = the path speed or x-y coupling drives it (operator's hypothesis). Only f8_laps changes.
# Pass marks are PROPOSED. UNVERIFIED: never flown.
campaign lab-e-exp-pid-3l-u0-half
rate 100
log velocity_loops camera_fusion thrust_model xy_ctrl ekf_states optical_flow
slow 50 estimator_truth takeoff_gate nn4 drift_nn mrac_3l mrac_theta mrac_shadow
exp pid_3l
set g_traj_ff_shift_s=0 g_land_xy_gate_cm=10 g_xyc_delay_ticks=21
takeoff 0.5 mrac_injection=0
hold 3
set traj_p.move_s=18 traj_p.ret_s=3 traj_p.hold_s=1 traj_p.profile=1 traj_p.ramp_s=2 traj_p.yaw_follow=0
preset figure8 f8_a_cm=30 f8_laps=1
hold 3
land
